### ==========================================
### AUTH
### ==========================================

### 1. Registrar usuario
### Crea User + Cart
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "santiago",
  "email": "santiago@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### 2. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "santiago@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ==========================================
### PRODUCTS
### ==========================================

### 3. Obtener productos
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### 4. Obtener producto específico
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### CART
### ==========================================

### 5. Obtener mi carrito
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### 6. Agregar Laptop x2
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}


### 7. Agregar Mouse x3
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 2,
  "quantity": 3
}


### 8. Consultar carrito
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### 9. Actualizar cantidad de un CartItem
### Cambia el ID según el CartItem creado
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1
}


### 10. Eliminar un CartItem
### Cambia el ID según corresponda
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 11. Vaciar carrito
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ==========================================
### CHECKOUT
### ==========================================

### 12. Checkout exitoso
### NO necesita cartId
POST {{baseUrl}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### 13. Intentar checkout nuevamente
### Debe fallar porque el carrito quedó vacío
POST {{baseUrl}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### ORDERS
### ==========================================

### 14. Consultar mis órdenes
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
### 15. Agregar producto sin stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 5,
  "quantity": 1
}


### 16. Checkout con producto sin stock
### Debe fallar
POST {{baseUrl}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### 17. Comprobar que el carrito sigue teniendo el producto
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### 18. Comprobar que NO se creó una nueva orden
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json